      "subject": "fix(learning): uncommitted documents no longer block learning cycles (CL-1e)",
      "body": "A Learning Record written by the Runtime has no git timestamp until it is committed, and Genesis treated that as a discovery error that blocked the whole capture, so LR-2026-0001 was never admitted or promoted. Learning cycles now leave uncommitted documents out of the window; they are learned once committed. Full Genesis replays still treat it as an error.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AHtXdN7VRusNxTFHzk5uFe",
